#library domain-variables CO STUDYID:Identifier DOMAIN:Identifier RDOMAIN:Identifier USUBJID:Identifier COSEQ:Identifier IDVAR:Identifier IDVARVAL:Identifier "COREF:Record Qualifier" COVAL:Topic "COVAL1:Topic" "COEVAL:Record Qualifier" CODTC:Timing
dataset CO
col STUDYID type=Char
